,"author":"Ichika","authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","viewCount":968,"published":1783593110952,"lengthSeconds":4615,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"Rii2b4wOx7E","title":"【Day295】初心者エンジニア、C# でアプリ開発する！！","author":"Ichika","authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","viewCount":1500,"published":1783593110952,"lengthSeconds":12161,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false}],"liveStreamsTimestamp":{"$$date":1786185110952},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n今日の配信おやすみです🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nなぜなら・・・\n配属お祝いでご飯食べにいくからです！！\n\n美味しいご飯いっぱい食べてくる😤✨️\n\nみんな今日もいい夢見てね〜🫶🏻\n\nP.s\n私は一応夢の中でFileStreamクラスについて勉強しようかなと思います🙄","postId":"UgkxggbPSbeUjuEtFoQR69_dCeoI7kdH4qug","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785925964005,"voteCount":59,"postContent":null,"commentCount":7,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n\nこんちか～🌸\nみんな、いつもライブ配信をみてくれて本当にありがとうございます✨️\n\nそして、突然ですが来週のご報告です。\n来週は色々とバタバタしそうなので、\n配信を一週間おやすみすることにしました！\n\nこれまでは、配信はなるべく休まず続けたいと思ってやってきました。\nですが、色々なことが一度に重なって、現在は体調崩し中です😭\n\nということで、\n今週いっぱいは配信をお休みして、\n来週の土曜日（8月1日）に元気よく戻ってこられるようにします💪\n\n次回のライブはこちら↓\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/272-MYTu4SQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/272-MYTu4SQ</a>\n\n配信ではみんなの言葉に、いつもとっても元気をもらっていました。\n本当にありがとうね🥹\n\nまた来週会いましょう～✨️\nみんなが来週も良い夢見られますように🙏🙏\n\n\n\n🌸⋆⁺₊✩ーーーーーーEnglishーーーーーー✩₊⁺⋆🌸\n\n\n\n[Announcement]\n\nHello everyone, konchika🌸\nThank you so much, as always, for watching my live streams ✨️\n\nSo, this is sudden, but here&apos;s an update about next week.\nThings are going to be pretty hectic next week, so I&apos;ve decided to take a one-week break from streaming!\n\nUp until now, I&apos;ve always tried to keep streaming without taking breaks whenever I could. But with a bunch of things piling up all at once, I&apos;m actually feeling a bit under the weather right now 😭\n\nSo I&apos;ll be taking this week off, and I&apos;ll come back full of energy next Saturday (August 1st) 💪\n\nNext live → <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/272-MYTu4SQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/272-MYTu4SQ</a>\n\nYour words during my streams have always given me so much energy.\nThank you, truly!!\n\nSee you next week~ ✨️\nWishing you all sweet dreams 🙏🙏","postId":"UgkxEvl1B7EH7a5-TFqaDYNxHPNvdLCAnpMK","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784975564006,"voteCount":77,"postContent":null,"commentCount":18,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n2026年7月20日の配信はお休みにします🙇🏻‍♀️🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nマジですみません…\n会社の研修関連の自己学習の部分終わらず、今夜配信できそうにありませんでした😭😭\n\n今日海の日だから配信でSUMMER SONG歌うって言ってたのに…ごめんよぉぉ😭\n\nでも課題頑張ってきます！\n\nみんないい夢見てねん〜🌙\n（サービス残業じゃないから安心してね！）\n\n[Announcement]\nStream is on break for July 20, 2026 🙇🏻‍♀️🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nSo sorry, everyone…\nThe self-study part of my work training isn&apos;t finished yet, so I won&apos;t be able to stream tonight 😭😭\n\nToday&apos;s a Japanese holiday (Marine Day) and I said I&apos;d sing &quot;Summer Song&quot;… I&apos;m so sorry 😭\n\nHave good dreams, everyone~🌙\n(Don&apos;t worry, this isn&apos;t unpaid overtime! 😊)","postId":"UgkxetByA8x6pSOtSne9bJhBY-Ku3JVpelXZ","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784975564006,"voteCount":60,"postContent":null,"commentCount":4,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n\n本日、同期との夜ご飯会につき配信おやすみです！\n2日連続休みになってすみません😭\n\nその代わりショート動画で勉強vlog出す予定です🙌（出せなかったらごめんね🙏🙏）\n\n金曜日の夜もみんないい夢見てね〜🌸\n\nそういえば、\n昨日発症した熱は下がりました！\n一日で元気になった🫶🏻🎉\n\nみんなも体調気をつけて、土日楽しんでね♪","postId":"UgkxVhsGAZad3TsMnciHgij5fK1WqmPPxbay","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784370764006,"voteCount":45,"postContent":null,"commentCount":4,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n今日配信おやすみします🙇🏻‍♀️\n\n熱が出ました…\n\nめちゃくちゃ微熱だからおでこに冷えピタ張って対抗してるんですけど、朝から体の怠さが治らないんです…\n\nなぜなのよ！！🤢\n\n今日は早めにお休みします！ごめんよ😭😭\n明日は元気になりますように🙏🙏\n\nーーー\n\n\n【Announcement】\nNo stream today, sorry 🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nI&apos;ve got a fever...\n\nIt&apos;s a pretty low-grade one, so I&apos;ve been fighting it off with a cooling patch on my forehead, but the body fatigue just won&apos;t go away...\n\nWhyyyy!! 🤢\n\nI&apos;ve felt like this since this morning, so I&apos;m calling it an early night tonight! Sorry everyone 😭😭\n\nHoping I&apos;ll be back to normal tomorrow 🙏🙏","postId":"UgkxT8jp2uUPbApU2O_XpXQzlVcaJGd9pp09","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784370764006,"voteCount":67,"postContent":null,"commentCount":9,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】\n今日の配信はおやすみです🙇🏻‍♀️\n\nなんとなんと、\n親戚とのお食事会があるんです〜🎊\n\nみんなも美味しいご飯食べて、いい夢見れますように🫶🏻\n\n【ひとりごと】\nずっと疑問なんだけど、\nなんで月曜日って毎週毎週やってくるのでしょうか？\n私は信じられません！！\n土日がずっと続けばいいのにな〜\n\nでもお腹空かせながら頑張ったあと、\n次に食べたものは世界一美味しい気がするし。\n\nこれと同じで、\n忙しい平日があるからこそ土日が楽しいのかな？\n\nもしかして、、お腹と一緒なのかい？！！\n\nそれならまぁ月曜日も悪くないか😤\n\nきっと美味しいご飯食べたら、月曜日からのお仕事にも耐えられるはずね💪\n\nみんな！！月曜日からもお仕事頑張ろうね😭😭\nでも無理しすぎないでね。\n\n\nーーーーーーEnglishーーーーーー\n\n【Announcement】\n\nNo stream today 🙇🏻‍♀️\nGuess what,\nI&apos;ve got a dinner with my relatives 🥳 yaaay\nI hope you all get to enjoy some delicious food and have good dreams 🫶🏻\n\n【Just thinking out loud】\n\nI&apos;ve always wondered,\nwhy does Monday come around week after week? I just can&apos;t believe it!!\nI wish the weekends would just go on forever (´・ω・`)\nBut after pushing through while hungry,\nthe next thing I eat somehow feels like the best in the world.\nSo in the same way,\nmaybe it&apos;s because of the busy weekdays that the weekends are fun?\nCould it be… the same as being hungry?!!\nIf that&apos;s the case… well, Monday isn&apos;t so bad after all.\n\nI&apos;m sure once I eat something good, I&apos;ll be able to handle work from Monday 💪\n\nEveryoneee!!\nDon&apos;t push yourselves too hard at work this week either, okay? 🌸","postId":"UgkxcyPYdTHhYe2W2b2Ne-jm6ziF1laHNdWk","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1783593164006,"voteCount":87,"postContent":null,"commentCount":7,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"【お知らせ】今夜の配信はお休みします🙇🏻‍♀️\n​\nごめんね…毎日がんばりたいと思ってたんだけど、今日は災難だったんです😭\n\n会社の研修でついていけずに落ち込んでいたら、そのあとなぜイスから落ちちゃって、しかもトイレに行ったら、今度は便座の除菌クリーナーみたいな機械に頭を強くぶつけちゃったの(´；ω；`)ｶﾅｼｽｷﾞ\n\nしょうもないことの連続なんだけど、急に自分が情けなく思えてきて、今涙流してるところです😭\n\nとりあえず今夜は休憩します🙏\n\nいつも優しい言葉をかけてくれて本当にありがとうね。みんながいなかったらもっと昔に即心折れてたよ😭😭\n\n今日の災難は私が代わりに吸収しておいたので、代わりにみんなに素敵なことがたっくさん起こりますように！！笑\n​また明日会おうね〜🌸\n\nーーー\n\n​[Notice] No stream tonight 🙇🏻‍♀️\n\n​I’m so sorry... I wanted to do my best every day, but today was a total disaster 😭\n\n​I was feeling down because I couldn&apos;t keep up with my company training.\n\nAfter that, I randomly fell off my chair, and when I went to the bathroom, I hit my head hard on a sanitizer dispenser... (´；ω；`) So sad!\n\n​It&apos;s just a series of silly things, but I suddenly felt so pathetic, and now I&apos;m crying 😭\n\n​Anyway, I&apos;m going to take a rest tonight 🙏\n\n​Thank you so much for always sending me sweet words. Without you guys, I would have given up a long time ago 😭😭\n\n​I took all the bad luck today, so I hope tons of wonderful things happen to you all instead!! lol\n\n​Sweet dreams, everyone!\nAnd see you tomorrow 🌸","postId":"Ugkxlaq6QIKP2pwncBUS61vv0qArOPmRJchx","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1783593164007,"voteCount":180,"postContent":null,"commentCount":34,"authorId":"UCAsUKYMDlolvZyHAAzr1xhA","author":"いちか - Ichika","type":"community"},{"postText":"本日の配信について\n\n引っ越し作業も終わって実家戻れました！！\nでも定期券買い忘れてました😭😭\n今から買いに行ってくるので配信は夜10時からに変更します！\n少々お待ちよ😭\n\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/35p1_tFQWEw?si=qLwJSruQPqupyypn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/live/35p1_tFQWEw?si=qLwJSruQPqupyypn</a>","postId":"Ugkxzw99HHPGv9bz29N87BkRDsRefjTo6_zV","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/IXWHhQQ1Dium7AVxs0YXsED0Zj7B8BgdyrDywlUBqt0KX5u4zlRCMr5uCUVr3UrSqN8MdYTRFw=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1781001164007,"voteCount":64,"postContent":null,"commentCount":2,"