{"_id":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","communityPosts":[{"postText":"Build AI apps and agents in Python with free hands-on practice in PyCharm.\n\nArdit Sulce’s Gen AI Engineer Bootcamp teaches you how to create practical AI applications, including a local coding assistant, RAG apps, Google Sheets automations, image-aware AI apps, and a voice AI assistant.\n\nStart with the free PyCharm practice: <a href=\"https://jb.gg/academy/ai-apps-in-python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jb.gg/academy/ai-apps-in-python</a>","postId":"UgkxrAWOnO1CGyQbzlXDKqi4_JiMyKzC_vlP","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1786098763907,"voteCount":50,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/uwR8WAgp2SJ4L6gCYAIKT9jhdm7IUrWs3UF02RtmgaubGfRpe-YMiEs0DTEGHRVLs41SdDNGPcQX=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"Does AI coding actually improve software, or just produce more of it? \n\nIn the latest episode of The Marco Show, Sébastien Deleuze from the Spring Framework and Spring AI team talks about why the hard part is still making the right decisions, not just writing code faster.\n\nWatch the episode and join the giveaway 👇","postId":"UgkxmRhtnovYkSkyJJRQFRgBnhJcD9D-rraO","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1786012363907,"voteCount":19,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"mCOGZGV48hU","title":"Inside the Mind of a Spring Framework Maintainer - Sébastien Deleuze | The Marco Show","author":"IntelliJ IDEA, a JetBrains IDE","authorId":"UC4ogdcPcIAOOMJktgBMhQnQ","description":"Sébastien Deleuze shares how 13 years on the Spring team shaped his pragmatic approach to building software, and how that mindset carries into Spring AI. Marco and Sébastien discuss what...","viewCount":2570,"published":1786012363907,"lengthSeconds":2438,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"New AI terms drop faster than anyone can track. In this video, we break down the four we believe everyone should know:\n• Prompt engineering – how you phrase what you ask\n• Context engineering – what the model actually sees\n• Harness engineering – giving the model tools to act\n• Loop engineering – the system that prompts your agent for you\n\nWatch the full video 👇","postId":"UgkxRBrZcCpfR7VtCyWNbP098XkVEGIQeogg","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785580363907,"voteCount":20,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"skut_4jdvzc","title":"How AI Agents Work: Prompt, Context, Harness & Loop Explained","author":"JetBrains","authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","description":"The AI world loves buzzwords – but few of these terms actually matter. \n\nJoin Kristel Cocoli as she cuts through the noise and walks you through the four concepts that genuinely build on...","viewCount":5698,"published":1784975563907,"lengthSeconds":745,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":1,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"🚀 Build with Kotlin. Ship it everywhere.\n\nJoin Shipaton 2026 and compete for the Ship Kotlin Everywhere Award. Reuse the Kotlin you know to build and launch a real app for Android, iOS, desktop, and web.\n\nGet support from idea to launch with:\n\n💻 A 90-day subscription to IntelliJ IDEA Ultimate\n🤖 60 days of free access to Junie, JetBrains’ AI coding agent\n📘 A starter guide covering KMP basics, project structure, code sharing, libraries, and publishing\n💬 Support from JetBrains Developer Advocates on Discord\n🎙️ A live Q&amp;A webinar on August 25\n\nBuild and ship between August 1 and September 30. Share your journey through a blog post, devlog, or social media updates to earn extra points.\n\nLearn more 👇\n<a href=\"https://jb.gg/6szji5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jb.gg/6szji5</a>","postId":"UgkxnM7wnBUyhapWykiFWcr7D-j11UaTLfNw","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785407563907,"voteCount":83,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/4jPkUnCcjbeFIEwZJODyXr76APQEuX5iPMT3btadVfEotmH41b5um0nhs9qGBmzSxwB0f10Vj-Or6w=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"Is vibe coding actually making Java developers worse? In the latest episode of The Marco Show, Josh Long (Spring Developer Advocate, Broadcom) explains why generating more code isn&apos;t the same as building better software, and what the JVM&apos;s real shot at the AI era looks like.\n\n👉 Watch the episode and join the giveaway: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_ftzJ33mCTI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/watch?v=_ftzJ33mCTI</a>","postId":"UgkxbvRy26WyCeLlvXHkLVu5fId-ioriIdnE","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784975563907,"voteCount":196,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/6RAVTm5_ir6w1B9aW8Uf66GcIDi8uuCPdYmCE9ueWbuKDcjZFqZzhNpF6I848Vv3AXggPagDW2yFgA=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"Coding agents work best when they understand your codebase.\n\nJetBrains Context gives Claude Agent, OpenAI Codex, and JetBrains Junie repository intelligence to work more effectively across production-scale codebases, delivering up to:\n• 68% fewer agent turns\n• 59% lower latency\n• 48% lower cost\n\nAs part of the JetBrains AI for Teams and Organizations rollout, JetBrains Context is now available in free early access.\n\nLearn more: <a href=\"https://jb.gg/1male9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jb.gg/1male9</a>","postId":"Ugkx9ErV4NdlLAP8fL6yFzA9WK71KsSe0cvH","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784975563907,"voteCount":153,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/ChA4s-D8AKGsIYcSHx9V9aeEpCFC0CNB4T6c77nPHEHhS9wic8Xl7L0OTpiuS4Oqeu3bCiEKoqVQ=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"🎉 Kotlin is 15! Leave a note for its future – add a birthday wish or prediction for Kotlin. You can even celebrate alongside Kodee by adding your own photo. Then share it with the community.\n\nMake yours here: <a href=\"https://jb.gg/effect-yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jb.gg/effect-yt</a>\n\n👇Where do you think Kotlin will be in another 15 years? Tell us in the comments.","postId":"UgkxPv4AB6QN_X7eVij_erTQZ6gKd23KmmMH","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784975563908,"voteCount":153,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/l0yX-0VS-m0yDkt-j5Fm3ZoDBpoQUSh9Jad3iYlEUuM43vDbN5Xlu-HiL1LX6ujMntE9_67z7zvHsOw=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1","width":640,"height":640}]},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"YouTrack Helpdesk now supports customer groups, helping teams manage customer requests by company or deliver internal services by department, while tailoring support for each group. This release also includes Whiteboards auto-layout and widgets, redesigned Gantt charts, simpler MCP connections, ClickUp and Asana imports, and new apps 👉 <a href=\"https://jb.gg/yt20262jbyc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">jb.gg/yt20262jbyc</a>","postId":"UgkxMaGkXSByGB8SNhL7K-t7rTnluIvUgH_1","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784370763908,"voteCount":10,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"nN0Htjz0n28","title":"YouTrack Helpdesk. Customer Groups","author":"YouTrack by JetBrains","authorId":"UCazp8sGTwS_5wYyqg_Z1VYA","description":"YouTrack Helpdesk now supports customer groups, helping B2B support agents tailor the support experience to different clients. Support teams can manage tickets by company, team, or organization,...","viewCount":354,"published":1783593163908,"lengthSeconds":58,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCGp4UBwpTNegd_4nCpuBcow","author":"JetBrains","type":"community"},{"postText":"Kotlin now has its own public benchmark for AI coding agents 🚀\n\nThe Kotlin Benchmark ranks agents on 105 engineering tasks from open-source Kotlin repositories.\n\nCompare agents by resolution rate, token cost, and latency, and dive into the methodology.\n\n👉 <a href=\"https://kotl.in/benchmark-yt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">kotl.in/benchmark-yt</a>","postId":"UgkxAXdg4JwYq94q6RaDXVHZ21NbPmtnToLj","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/wBPpTj2jbdy-ouAuowvSatAxW01MoFxm8mJB0YCljWkoEhw_UV4hjgziTzprMeFYWRUr4uNMrQ=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1784370763908,"voteCount":85,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/VWS9idcSlyOqXisZlCmh4ZtjLubkxLK5AHD1Zhyb3dk8_-spCpm3mCjwfeSk2GTxxrTuGs-letOO=s640-c-fcrop64=1,00000000ffffffff-rw-nd-v1