{"_id":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","videos":[{"type":"video","videoId":"et1M_qO2fvM","title":"I Built a Beautiful Typing Speed Test App in C (Live WPM & Accuracy) | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":416,"published":1788390359987,"lengthSeconds":5474,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"TP6ElvI1rWU","title":"I Built a Complete Minesweeper Game in C (It Looks AMAZING in Terminal) | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":16000,"published":1787839559987,"lengthSeconds":4522,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"PcG2xrHgutU","title":"I Built a Complete Tic-Tac-Toe Game in C (It Looks AMAZING in Terminal) | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":3100,"published":1787234759987,"lengthSeconds":2390,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"lA1I0xp6Ivk","title":"Building a Custom Memory Allocator in C | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":1100,"published":1787234759987,"lengthSeconds":3625,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"1TiEd_O6p3E","title":"I Built a Physics-Based Marble Pinball Game from Scratch in C | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":1300,"published":1786629959987,"lengthSeconds":6605,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"z1ds5xXSUwI","title":"I Built Terminal Tetris from Scratch in C | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":1500,"published":1786025159988,"lengthSeconds":6243,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"NOuXIzypSbw","title":"I Built a Real-Time System Monitor from Scratch in C |  Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":5600,"published":1785852359988,"lengthSeconds":7453,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"uPRKlSIEN58","title":"I Built a Classic Snake Game in C (With Golden Food & Obstacles!) | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":657,"published":1785852359988,"lengthSeconds":2870,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"9Xx5I9StU_Q","title":"I Built a Complete RPG Game in C (It Looks AMAZING in Terminal) | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":26000,"published":1785852359988,"lengthSeconds":6198,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"T4DaMztV_00","title":"I Built a Task Manager in C | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":575,"published":1785852359988,"lengthSeconds":3777,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"wLzqhNU_MKo","title":"Animated Planet with 3D Ring and Orbiting Moons | Neovim Editor | ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":315,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":1385,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"CLdvh9QLTKM","title":"Coding A Multiplayer Game in C | Neovim Editor | ASMR Programming","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":481,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":916,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"uSXWTkGDDnM","title":"I Built a Mini Shell from Scratch in C | Neovim Editor | ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":1000,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":903,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"7dDdeDXFCnI","title":"Stopwatch in C | Neovim Editor | ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":352,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":984,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"RnllkjX-W7U","title":"NOTES APP in C | Terminal-Based | Neovim Editor | ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":789,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":1838,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"bJ7D7GxGLi4","title":"Login Page in HTML & CSS - Neovim Editor - ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":451,"published":1756887407988,"lengthSeconds":1385,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false},{"type":"video","videoId":"DyLKYMNPq2w","title":"create,Save any image as a Pattern in photoshop","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","viewCount":38000,"published":1409760935988,"lengthSeconds":99,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false}],"videosTimestamp":{"$$date":1788444359988},"communityPosts":[{"postText":"1,000 of you. In the terminal with me.\n\nWhen I started this channel, I didn&apos;t have a plan. Just a terminal window and the honest process of building something while thinking out loud. I figured a handful of people might find that interesting. I didn&apos;t expect a community.\n\nBut here we are.\n\nEvery debugging session that dragged on too long, every side quest into why something works the way it does, every late night staring at an error message until it finally clicked, you were there for it. Not for a finished product, but for the process. That means more to me than I can really put into words.\n\n\nThank you for the love and support, and for the constructive feedback along the way. The comments that pushed me to explain things better, slow down, or try a different approach. That input shaped this channel as much as anything I did on my own. Thank you for building such a chill and supportive community with me.\n\nThis milestone isn&apos;t really about the number. It&apos;s about the fact that there&apos;s now a thousand of you who care about the same thing I do: understanding how things actually work, one line at a time, closer to the system, and build.\n\nThis is just the beginning.\n\nMore code, more flow, more terminal. Let&apos;s keep going.❤️","postId":"UgkxmaY8yzxV8NuEoh-c5HQpDNbubYYL1wIy","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1786098763885,"voteCount":14,"postContent":null,"commentCount":9,"authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","author":"Everything Terminal","type":"community"},{"postText":"I built terminal Tetris game from scratch in C.\nNo game engine, no GUI toolkit, just C, the terminal, and a lot of coding.\nIt was such a fun project: game loops, collision detection, piece rotation, line clearing, scoring, combos, and all rendered inside the terminal.\n\nIn this build:\n✅ Classic 7-piece Tetris gameplay\n✅ Rotation with basic wall-kicks\n✅ Line clearing, scoring, combos, and levels\n✅ Increasing gravity speed\n✅ Next-piece preview\n✅ Clean terminal restoration on exit\n✅ POSIX signal handling for safe Ctrl+C exits\n\nThank you so much for watching and for supporting me!","postId":"UgkxkZuz3qI4RDgvBrm9D7tUcKNq2X_CU-5x","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785925963885,"voteCount":10,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"z1ds5xXSUwI","title":"I Built Terminal Tetris from Scratch in C | Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","description":"🎧 Put your headphones on and enjoy this relaxing ASMR coding session! Today, we're building a complete, classic Terminal Tetris game from scratch using the C programming language.\n\nListen...","viewCount":1117,"published":1785839563885,"lengthSeconds":6243,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","author":"Everything Terminal","type":"community"},{"postText":"I&apos;ve been buried in this code for days.\nTetris, built from scratch in C, running straight in the terminal.\nThat snippet you&apos;re looking at? Tetromino shapes. Every piece, every rotation, just 1s and 0s in a grid. It took a while to get right.\nDropping the full build tomorrow. See you then!","postId":"UgkxgcDTkvQY9D5vsNyrXykpU8bPdw8ej_kg","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785753163885,"voteCount":43,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/00TUEs0DSthXI-RdL9b1YCeyl5k0p1syoBWH2j5z8BxsCIqchQb4iIAIkTSg-boA3IaEn-XgAVDKmQ=s555-c-fcrop64=1,000029a3ffffd396-rw-nd-v1","width":555,"height":555}]},"commentCount":8,"authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","author":"Everything Terminal","type":"community"},{"postText":"The System Monitor is finally up! 🚀️\nI&apos;m really happy with how this one turned out. It&apos;s a fully-featured, real-time system monitor built from scratch in C.\nCheck it out:\n<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NOuXIzypSbw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">youtube.com/watch?v=NOuXIzypSbw</a>","postId":"UgkxBgTwnKQoG_fO13ykZqxI1sWdOkL8chM-","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785321163885,"voteCount":9,"postContent":{"type":"video","content":{"type":"video","videoId":"NOuXIzypSbw","title":"I Built a Real-Time System Monitor from Scratch in C |  Neovim, tmux & ASMR Coding","author":"Everything Terminal","authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","description":"🎧 Put your headphones on and enjoy this relaxing ASMR coding session! Today, we're building a complete real-time System Monitor from scratch using the C programming language.\n\nListen to...","viewCount":4831,"published":1785321163885,"lengthSeconds":7453,"liveNow":false,"isUpcoming":false,"is4k":false,"is8k":false,"isNew":false,"isVr180":false,"isVr360":false,"is3d":false,"hasCaptions":false}},"commentCount":2,"authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","author":"Everything Terminal","type":"community"},{"postText":"I built a system monitor from scratch this week. It reads straight from /proc. No magic libraries parsing the kernel data for you.\nThis is the whole shape of the program in 18 lines. Every function it needs, before a single one is written.\nThat&apos;s the deal with C. You tell the compiler what&apos;s coming before you show up with it.\n🖥️ What it does:\n• Real-time CPU, RAM &amp; Swap tracking\n• Top processes sorted by CPU usage\n• Color-coded alerts when things get hot\nI&apos;ll drop the video soon. Stay tuned!","postId":"UgkxR7sAwpuYnC3bKtry3mUStSOYepZBEP1u","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1785148363885,"voteCount":31,"postContent":{"type":"image","content":[{"url":"https://yt3.ggpht.com/dRnaIVWoMc1Gpy0bGGMV6wzRsqS0qRdFYpSmgx81eHaq3UlJ6pmtvVQQiOl1q9saSjyakpvy8Nl_ZA=s437-c-fcrop64=1,000000008b7dffff-rw-nd-v1","width":437,"height":437}]},"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UCK2StGMSPgXKWu_CuiVY2bg","author":"Everything Terminal","type":"community"},{"postText":"Guess what I&apos;m building?","postId":"UgkxMPREfP3zBSVDI3x8V41As-vKXIfRDQ6p","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/cQ4-UiMl2lOe6MmdiI30hXPBuvcRUEYS7l6pCl4qhFKuDZJaF4Ce3ruif7mH3Xhb6H5IRDj8=s48-c-k-