{"_id":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","communityPosts":[{"postText":"Just a heads up: I had a &quot;Making A Beat At 11 PM&quot; moment with my new song. Mostly minor mistakes and oversights. While i can&apos;t replace the youtube version, bandcamp is a different story, so please go listen to this song on bandcamp for a definitive experience instead, lol.\r\n<a href=\"https://nu11.bandcamp.com/track/break-enter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">nu11.bandcamp.com/track/break-enter</a>","postId":"UgkxMqKkK04tCQKQZoTcFH94JdApv-T1iQQm","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1773225163890,"voteCount":29,"postContent":null,"commentCount":null,"authorId":"UC_flDR5aKfSmPMsFGR4B7EA","author":"nu11","type":"community"},{"postText":"I finished my new song a few days ago, now i&apos;m just waiting until i can submit it to botb Winter Chip (hopefully)","postId":"UgkxccUy9Q-jvbUAx_UZNNQy6kPdC1N5CdFI","authorThumbnails":[{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s76-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":76,"height":76},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":48,"height":48},{"url":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ptbYaHRm5nEY0z-JbBZp3Z708tgEY7fBlIt6xinjEpWTrBJyNxNQhcYoBqiyxJy6q6SRHnc0i38=s32-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj-mo","width":32,"height":32}],"publishedTime":1768041163891,"voteCoun